# Generated audio is regenerable; the smoke cloning reference and its
# provenance record are rebuilt by scripts/make_reference.py --smoke.
inputs/smoke_reference_*

# Requirements PDFs are the acceptance authority for this project and must be
# recoverable from history. The *.pdf rule above meant neither was ever
# committed, so when the problem-statement PDF was corrupted by a text-mode
# transfer there was no intact copy to restore. Track them explicitly.
!docs/*.pdf
